    "created_at": "2022-02-18T12:01:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-18T12:01:36Z",
    "body": "After re-reading the spec again, I agree that the spec is correct. I missed the point that even though the constructor may fail without any synchronization, all the events about the fact are fired only after native event queue has already been run.",
